   "lead": "<p>M4 的配色逻辑比较清楚。官方原本的模板可能<strong>看不出主要颜色</strong>，买下来会<strong>和预期不符</strong>。</p>",
   "leadIsStub": false,
   "body": "<h3 id=\"s1\">看哪几处</h3>\n<ul class=\"spots\"><li class=\"spot\" data-img=\"./%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9/%E9%80%89%E7%9A%AE%E7%84%9A%E8%AF%80/M4A1/%E6%9E%81%E5%93%81/%E9%BB%84%E8%89%B2%E7%9E%84%E5%87%86%E9%95%9C%E5%89%8D%E7%AB%AF%E8%89%B2.png\" data-alt=\"瞄准镜前端色\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"spot-term\">瞄准镜前端色</span><span class=\"spot-desc\">这张是黄</span><span class=\"spot-ico\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><img class=\"spot-img\" src=\"./%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9/%E9%80%89%E7%9A%AE%E7%84%9A%E8%AF%80/M4A1/%E6%9E%81%E5%93%81/%E9%BB%84%E8%89%B2%E7%9E%84%E5%87%86%E9%95%9C%E5%89%8D%E7%AB%AF%E8%89%B2.png\" alt=\"瞄准镜前端色\" loading=\"lazy\"></li><li class=\"spot\" data-img=\"./%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9/%E9%80%89%E7%9A%AE%E7%84%9A%E8%AF%80/M4A1/%E6%9E%81%E5%93%81/%E7%B4%AB%E8%89%B2%E5%86%85%E6%9E%84%E8%89%B2.png\" data-alt=\"内构色\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"spot-term\">内构色</span><span class=\"spot-desc\">这张是紫</span><span class=\"spot-ico\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><img class=\"spot-img\" src=\"./%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9/%E9%80%89%E7%9A%AE%E7%84%9A%E8%AF%80/M4A1/%E6%9E%81%E5%93%81/%E7%B4%AB%E8%89%B2%E5%86%85%E6%9E%84%E8%89%B2.png\" alt=\"内构色\" loading=\"lazy\"></li><li class=\"spot\" data-img=\"./%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9/%E9%80%89%E7%9A%AE%E7%84%9A%E8%AF%80/M4A1/%E6%9E%81%E5%93%81/%E8%93%9D%E8%89%B2%E4%B8%BB%E8%89%B2.png\" data-alt=\"主色\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"spot-term\">主色</span><span class=\"spot-desc\">这张是蓝</span><span class=\"spot-ico\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><img class=\"spot-img\" src=\"./%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9/%E9%80%89%E7%9A%AE%E7%84%9A%E8%AF%80/M4A1/%E6%9E%81%E5%93%81/%E8%93%9D%E8%89%B2%E4%B8%BB%E8%89%B2.png\" alt=\"主色\" loading=\"lazy\"></li></ul>\n<div class=\"gallery g1\" data-n=\"1\"><figure><img src=\"./%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9/%E9%80%89%E7%9A%AE%E7%84%9A%E8%AF%80/M4A1/%E6%9E%81%E5%93%81/M4A1-%E6%B8%B8%E4%B9%90%E5%9B%AD%E9%85%8D%E8%89%B2-100_A.jpg\" alt=\"例枪：游乐园配色，上面三处的特写都从这把枪上截取\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>例枪：游乐园配色，上面三处的特写都从这把枪上截取</figcaption></figure></div>\n<p>游乐园配色的另外三张。</p>\n<div class=\"gallery g3\" data-n=\"3\"><figure><img src=\"./%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9/%E9%80%89%E7%9A%AE%E7%84%9A%E8%AF%80/M4A1/%E6%9E%81%E5%93%81/M4A1-%E6%B8%B8%E4%B9%90%E5%9B%AD%E9%85%8D%E8%89%B2-100_B.jpg\" alt=\"游乐园配色，检视\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>游乐园配色，检视</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"./%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9/%E9%80%89%E7%9A%AE%E7%84%9A%E8%AF%80/M4A1/%E6%9E%81%E5%93%81/M4A1-%E6%B8%B8%E4%B9%90%E5%9B%AD%E9%85%8D%E8%89%B2-100_C.jpg\" alt=\"游乐园配色，瞄准\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>游乐园配色，瞄准</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"./%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9/%E9%80%89%E7%9A%AE%E7%84%9A%E8%AF%80/M4A1/%E6%9E%81%E5%93%81/M4A1-%E6%B8%B8%E4%B9%90%E5%9B%AD%E9%85%8D%E8%89%B2-100_D.jpg\" alt=\"游乐园配色，持枪\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>游乐园配色，持枪</figcaption></figure></div>\n<h3 id=\"s2\">选法</h3>\n<p>按上面的颜色挑配色就行。贴片固定是<strong>黑色加内构色</strong>，和官方改模贴片对不上。</p>\n<div class=\"gallery g1\" data-n=\"1\"><figure><img src=\"./%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9/%E9%80%89%E7%9A%AE%E7%84%9A%E8%AF%80/M4A1/%E6%9E%81%E5%93%81/%E8%B4%B4%E7%89%87%E8%89%B2.png\" alt=\"贴片色\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>贴片色</figcaption></figure></div>\n<h3 id=\"s3\">推荐模板</h3>\n<p>黑血。</p>\n<div class=\"gallery g2\" data-n=\"2\"><figure><img src=\"./%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9/%E9%80%89%E7%9A%AE%E7%84%9A%E8%AF%80/M4A1/%E6%9E%81%E5%93%81/M4A1-%E9%BB%91%E8%A1%80-001_B.jpg\" alt=\"黑血\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>黑血</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"./%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9/%E9%80%89%E7%9A%AE%E7%84%9A%E8%AF%80/M4A1/%E6%9E%81%E5%93%81/M4A1-%E9%BB%91%E8%A1%80-001_D.jpg\" alt=\"黑血，持枪\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>黑血，持枪</figcaption></figure></div>\n<p>印花指的是主色为奶白、带渐变的模板。主视角能看到<strong>淡淡的粉色</strong>，其余颜色可能不同。</p>\n<div class=\"gallery g2\" data-n=\"2\"><figure><img src=\"./%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9/%E9%80%89%E7%9A%AE%E7%84%9A%E8%AF%80/M4A1/%E6%9E%81%E5%93%81/M4A1-%E7%B4%AB%E7%99%BD%E5%8D%B0%E8%8A%B1%E9%9B%86-100_B.jpg\" alt=\"紫白印花集\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>紫白印花集</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"./%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9/%E9%80%89%E7%9A%AE%E7%84%9A%E8%AF%80/M4A1/%E6%9E%81%E5%93%81/M4A1-%E7%B4%AB%E7%99%BD%E5%8D%B0%E8%8A%B1%E9%9B%86-100_C.jpg\" alt=\"紫白印花集\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>紫白印花集</figcaption></figure></div>",
