   "title": "MK4 极品焚诀",
   "summary": "MK4 的配色拆成字母色、扳机色、主弹夹色、灯效；彩绘要看喷气口和棍子。",
   "author": "SHUXIN",
   "updated": "2026-10-28",
   "status": "草稿",
   "stability": "长期",
   "lead": "<p>MK4 的配色拆成四处：<strong>字母色、扳机色、主弹夹色、灯效</strong>。红白金这把是<strong>金色字母、红色扳机、银色主弹夹、白色灯效</strong>。正文以图为准。</p>",
   "leadIsStub": false,
   "body": "<h3 id=\"s1\">配色逻辑</h3>\n<ul class=\"spots\"><li class=\"spot\" data-img=\"./%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9/%E9%80%89%E7%9A%AE%E7%84%9A%E8%AF%80/MK4/%E6%9E%81%E5%93%81/%E5%AD%97%E6%AF%8D%E8%89%B2.png\" data-alt=\"字母色\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"spot-term\">字母色</span><span class=\"spot-desc\">这张是金</span><span class=\"spot-ico\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><img class=\"spot-img\" src=\"./%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9/%E9%80%89%E7%9A%AE%E7%84%9A%E8%AF%80/MK4/%E6%9E%81%E5%93%81/%E5%AD%97%E6%AF%8D%E8%89%B2.png\" alt=\"字母色\" loading=\"lazy\"></li><li class=\"spot\" data-img=\"./%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9/%E9%80%89%E7%9A%AE%E7%84%9A%E8%AF%80/MK4/%E6%9E%81%E5%93%81/%E6%89%B3%E6%9C%BA%E8%89%B2.png\" data-alt=\"扳机色\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"spot-term\">扳机色</span><span class=\"spot-desc\">这张是红</span><span class=\"spot-ico\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><img class=\"spot-img\" src=\"./%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9/%E9%80%89%E7%9A%AE%E7%84%9A%E8%AF%80/MK4/%E6%9E%81%E5%93%81/%E6%89%B3%E6%9C%BA%E8%89%B2.png\" alt=\"扳机色\" loading=\"lazy\"></li><li class=\"spot\" data-img=\"./%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9/%E9%80%89%E7%9A%AE%E7%84%9A%E8%AF%80/MK4/%E6%9E%81%E5%93%81/%E5%BC%B9%E5%A4%B9%E8%89%B2.png\" data-alt=\"主弹夹色\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"spot-term\">主弹夹色</span><span class=\"spot-desc\">这张是银</span><span class=\"spot-ico\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><img class=\"spot-img\" src=\"./%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9/%E9%80%89%E7%9A%AE%E7%84%9A%E8%AF%80/MK4/%E6%9E%81%E5%93%81/%E5%BC%B9%E5%A4%B9%E8%89%B2.png\" alt=\"主弹夹色\" loading=\"lazy\"></li><li class=\"spot\" data-img=\"./%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9/%E9%80%89%E7%9A%AE%E7%84%9A%E8%AF%80/MK4/%E6%9E%81%E5%93%81/%E7%81%AF%E6%95%88.png\" data-alt=\"灯效\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"spot-term\">灯效</span><span class=\"spot-desc\">这张是白</span><span class=\"spot-ico\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><img class=\"spot-img\" src=\"./%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9/%E9%80%89%E7%9A%AE%E7%84%9A%E8%AF%80/MK4/%E6%9E%81%E5%93%81/%E7%81%AF%E6%95%88.png\" alt=\"灯效\" loading=\"lazy\"></li></ul>\n<div class=\"gallery g1\" data-n=\"1\"><figure><img src=\"./%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9/%E9%80%89%E7%9A%AE%E7%84%9A%E8%AF%80/MK4/%E6%9E%81%E5%93%81/mk4-detail.jpg\" alt=\"例枪：红白金，上面四处的特写都从这把枪上截取\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>例枪：红白金，上面四处的特写都从这把枪上截取</figcaption></figure></div>\n<p>实战效果。</p>\n<div class=\"gallery g1\" data-n=\"1\"><figure><img src=\"./%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9/%E9%80%89%E7%9A%AE%E7%84%9A%E8%AF%80/MK4/%E6%9E%81%E5%93%81/mk4-field.jpg\" alt=\"实战效果\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>实战效果</figcaption></figure></div>\n<h3 id=\"s2\">改枪台</h3>\n<div class=\"gallery g2\" data-n=\"2\"><figure><img src=\"./%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9/%E9%80%89%E7%9A%AE%E7%84%9A%E8%AF%80/MK4/%E6%9E%81%E5%93%81/mk4-bench-1.jpg\" alt=\"改枪台一\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>改枪台一</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"./%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9/%E9%80%89%E7%9A%AE%E7%84%9A%E8%AF%80/MK4/%E6%9E%81%E5%93%81/mk4-bench-2.jpg\" alt=\"改枪台二\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>改枪台二</figcaption></figure></div>\n<h3 id=\"s3\">彩绘</h3>\n<p>看图上的蓝色箭头。喷气口的颜色会影响棍子的颜色，判断时一起看。</p>\n<div class=\"gallery g3\" data-n=\"3\"><figure><img src=\"./%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9/%E9%80%89%E7%9A%AE%E7%84%9A%E8%AF%80/MK4/%E6%9E%81%E5%93%81/%E5%BD%A9%E7%BB%98.jpg\" alt=\"彩绘，蓝色箭头\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>彩绘，蓝色箭头</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"./%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9/%E9%80%89%E7%9A%AE%E7%84%9A%E8%AF%80/MK4/%E6%9E%81%E5%93%81/%E5%BD%A9%E7%BB%98-%E5%B8%82%E5%9C%BA%E5%9B%BE.jpg\" alt=\"彩绘，市场\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>彩绘，市场</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"./%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9/%E9%80%89%E7%9A%AE%E7%84%9A%E8%AF%80/MK4/%E6%9E%81%E5%93%81/%E5%BD%A9%E7%BB%98-%E6%94%B9%E6%9E%AA%E5%8F%B0.jpg\" alt=\"彩绘，改枪台\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>彩绘，改枪台</figcaption></figure></div>\n<h3 id=\"s4\">讲解视频</h3>\n<ul class=\"links\"><li><a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1CKhz68ESv/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"lk-site\">BV1CKhz68ESv</span><span class=\"lk-t\">MK4 配色讲解</span><span class=\"lk-go\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></li></ul>",
